  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1225192,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Livres Classiques for Nintendo DS: A Literary Adventure\n\nStep into the world of classic literature with *100 Livres Classiques* for the Nintendo DS! This unique game offers a captivating blend of interactive storytelling and puzzle-solving, bringing beloved tales to life in a fresh and engaging way. \n\nExplore excerpts from 100 renowned literary works, spanning genres from adventure and romance to mystery and fantasy. Each story is presented in a beautifully illustrated format, with interactive elements that allow you to delve deeper into the narrative. \n\nGameplay revolves around solving puzzles and challenges directly inspired by the stories themselves. Decipher riddles, piece together clues, and navigate through interactive scenes to progress through each literary excerpt.  The game features both French and English language options, making it accessible to a wider audience.  *100 Livres Classiques* is perfect for book lovers of all ages, offering a delightful and educational experience that celebrates the power of classic literature. Rediscover the joy of reading in a whole new way!"
    },
